  = note: an escape sequence is a backslash and one of a, b, e, f, n, r, t, v, \, ' or ", three
          octal digits up to 377, x and two hexadecimal digits, u and four, or U and eight, with a
          number that is a Unicode character, which is at most 10FFFF and not D800 to DFFF
